# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore untuk Proyek Free Pascal (Math Worm)
# ==============================================================================

# 1. File Hasil Kompilasi & Build Artifacts Free Pascal
*.exe
*.o
*.ppu
*.or
*.rsj
*.compiled
*.a
*.so
*.dylib

# 2. File Backup Otomatis Editor / IDE (Lazarus, VS Code, Notepad++, dll.)
*.bak
*~
*.swp
*.swo
backup/

# 3. Direktori Pengaturan Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# 4. File Sampah Sistem Operasi
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# 5. Pengecualian Khusus (Whitelist)
# Pastikan SDL2.dll tetap di-commit agar siapa pun yang clone bisa langsung menjalankan game
!SDL2.dll
